  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanedikiyi mutembeli, kambanji kindi wumu hakumwila nindi, Eyi Nkuluŋaŋa, tala owu malola, ninowu matala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Wunamoni awa matala amaneni? Hikwakashala ilola nidimu dakanaŋamana helola di kwawu, dakabula kunatika hesekuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashakaminiyi hampidi yaOliveta yatalaŋana natembeli, aPetulu naYakoba naYowanu niAnderi, hiyakumwihula kwakanka wawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Atuleji mwani, yumiyi yamba kamwekana mwakanyi? Hakakeŋa kumana yuma yejimiyi kwakekala chinjikijilu chanka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakutachika kuyila nindi, Babalenu, akenda kayiluwaŋesha kudi muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa antu amavulu akenza mwijina dami, akela nawu, Diyi yami; akaluwaŋesha amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwakatiya majita ninsaŋu jamajita, bayi mwakaakamaku. Yumiyi chiŋa yakashika, ilaŋa kukumisha kanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa muza wakanyamuka nakulwa namuza, wanta nawanta; kwakekala ninyitentanshi kwacheŋi nakwacheŋi; kwakaholoka nzala. Yumiyi diyi yihuŋu yakutachika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa enu babalenu enu aweni, Muloŋakayitwala muyota, akayetela nimumashikola; mwakemana kumesu awanguvulu nawanyanta hamujimba wamami, kulonda kuyilila wunsahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsaŋu yayiwahi chiŋa akasambila kuyishimuna kunyuza yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakayitwalawu nakuyihana kudi ansompeshi, bayi mwakaakamaŋahu dehi yimwakahoshaku; mwakahosha yakayinkawu kuhosha mpinji oyu, muloŋa hiyenu mwakahoshaku, Spiritu Wajila diyi wakahosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyala wakajahisha mana kwindi, nitata yawantu wakajahisha mwanindi; anyana akanyamukila anvwali jawu, akayijahisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayihela kudi antu ejima hansaŋu yejina dami; Ilaŋa muntu wakakakela nikunsa diyi wakahanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chimwakamona chishimashima chakaletesha mahembi, hichikwimana kuchabula kutelela, yowu wukutaŋa ashinshiki, henohu owu akekala muYudeya akatemukili kwawu kumapidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niwakekala hewulu detala, chakasulukayi bayi eŋila nakunona chuma mwitala dinduku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakekala mwiha, bayi akafunta nakunona kahuma kinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa o yihuŋu yakamona akekala namavumu, niakaamwisha hamafuku owu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lombenu chakabuli kwikala hachila aka chamashika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hamafuku owu hakekala lukadi lwakadi kwikalaŋahu dehi, kufumisha hatachi haleŋeliyi Nzambi yuma, kushika nikulelu, hilwamba kekalaku nawa cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi Yehova kukehesha mafuku owu nehi, hikwakekala antu akahandaku; ilaŋa nayikehesheli hanyijimba yawatondewa atondeliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu neyi hakekala muntu wakayila nindi, Talenu Kristu iwu; hela nindi, Talenu owu; bayi mwaketiyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hakanyamuka aKristu akutwamba, niatuprofwetu akutwamba, akamwekesha yinjikijilu nayihayamisha, kulonda nawu akaluwaŋeshi atondewa, neyi chinatwesheki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinzenu kwenu kababalenu; talenu nayilejaŋahu dehi yuma yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa hamafuku akalondela lukadi olu, itaŋwa dakeyila, nikakweji hikakatoneka mwejuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitutumbwa twakaholoka mwiwulu, niŋovu jidi mumawulu jakakanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu akamona Mwana kamuntu hakwinza mumavu naŋovu yeneni nilubanji lwakulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu wakatemesha aŋelu jindi, wakapompesha indi atondewa kumpepela jiwana, kufumisha kunsa yamaseki, ndo nikunsa yewulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwatilenu maana kuchishimu chamutondu wachikuyu. Neyi mutayi wawu wukutachika kwovwaha, hiwukusapuka mafu, enu himukwiluka nenu mayinza adi kwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ninenu nawa chimukumona yumiyi hiyikwinza, ilukenu nenu wudi kwakwihi, kwoku kuyisu kachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja chalala nami, chisakichi hichakahitaku, chiŋa yuma yejimiyi yakamana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwulu niiseki akahita, Ilaŋa mazu ami hiyakahitaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
